# Google Cloud OAuth 2.0 Credentials (TVs and Limited Input devices)
# 1. Enable YouTube Data API v3 in Google Cloud Console
# 2. Create OAuth Client ID with type "TVs and Limited Input devices"
# 3. Add your email under OAuth consent screen -> Test users
YTMUSIC_CLIENT_ID=your_google_client_id_here.apps.googleusercontent.com
YTMUSIC_CLIENT_SECRET=your_google_client_secret_here

# Spotify Developer Credentials (Optional — only needed for Reverse Sync)
# 1. Go to https://developer.spotify.com/dashboard
# 2. Create an app (requires Spotify Premium account)
# 3. Copy Client ID and Client Secret
SPOTIFY_CLIENT_ID=your_spotify_client_id_here
SPOTIFY_CLIENT_SECRET=your_spotify_client_secret_here
